# Everything here is source, and all of it is happy with LF on Windows. Pinning
# the line ending keeps the checkout identical to the blob, so `cargo fmt
# --check` in CI and a local build never disagree over a carriage return.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are compared byte for byte by tests/schema_compatibility.rs.
tests/fixtures/*.json text eol=lf
